OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs major fires and flash floods have
OL,7,Fdominated the headlines in recent
OL,8,Fweeks, some positive success stories
OL,9,Fhave still been happening across the
OL,10,FWest Midlands - and we want to
OL,11,Fhighlight them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have a group of teenagers
OL,14,Fshining a light on men's mental health,
OL,15,FWorld Championships hopes for a woman
OL,16,Fwho was left paralysed after falling
OL,17,Ffrom her horse and a trading card game
OL,18,Fshop that is building a community in
OL,19,FShrewsbury.
OL,21,FHere is a look at some of those news
OL,22,Fstories from across the region:
